.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-remote-package-log 1  "geectl-remote-package-log 0.2.3" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-package\-log \- Show the commit history of a package
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote package\-log\fR [\fB\-\-range\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> <\fIPACKAGE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the commit history of a package
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-range\fR \fI<RANGE>\fR
Only entries in this revision range (`FROM:TO`, either side may be empty; a side is a revision number or a srcmd5)
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR
At most this many entries
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project the package lives in
.TP
<\fIPACKAGE\fR>
The package to show the history of
.SH VERSION
v0.2.3
